# Perl Hooks

> This file extends [common/hooks.md](common-hooks.mdc) with Perl-specific content.

## PostToolUse Hooks

Claude Code only — configure in `~/.claude/settings.json`. This Cursor install uses `.cursor/hooks.json` and must not gain a Claude settings file:

- **perltidy**: Auto-format `.pl` and `.pm` files after edit
- **perlcritic**: Run lint check after editing `.pm` files

## Warnings

- Warn about `print` in non-script `.pm` files — use `say` or a logging module (e.g., `Log::Any`)
